Description: Ordinal Bayesian Additive Regression Trees (OBART) for ordinal outcomes. This package is based on the original GPL-3 licensed BART package by Sparapani, Spanbauer, 
    and McCulloch, with modifications to support ordinal Bayesian modeling. For details on 
    the original BART methodology, see Sparapani et al. (2021), “Nonparametric Machine Learning 
    and Efficient Computation with Bayesian Additive Regression Trees: The BART R Package,” 
    Journal of Statistical Software, 97(1), 1–66. doi:10.18637/jss.v097.i01.
